<title>INDIA: India's Apollo Tyres 96/97 net rises.</title>
<headline>India's Apollo Tyres 96/97 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     363.2  vs    353.1</p>
<p>    Net sales	   14,269.1  vs 12,509.1</p>
<p>    Shr (rupees)	    12.16 vs     N/A</p>
<p>    Div (percentage)	40    vs     N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: Indian tyre maker Apollo Tyres Ltd said in a statement that the company was reviewing its work process with a view to enhancing overall efficiency.</p>
